=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play runall/ufw-inactive -------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Run All screen proposed for slice 8,$
# each row's state from the control's real Check, each change$
# the real control's Plan, all of them in one plan on the real$
# plan/apply engine. Which controls hardn.yml asks for, how a$
# row is skipped, a change pending read before any plan, and the$
# hostname asked whatever the risk are the gallery's stand-ins,$
# unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: runall/ufw-inactive$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. debian13 with ufw installed$
# and inactive, no rule, and the nameservers set: Enable and$
# root login off in one plan. hardn.yml: george with a key, port$
# 22, two nameservers, backups on, and enableUnattendedUpgrades,$
# enableUfwSshPolicy, configureDns and disableRootSSH true.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Already as asked$
   -  Firewall             Enable, SSH allowed$
   -  SSH Login            Root login off$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Already as asked$
   -  DNS                  Already as asked$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# engine: controls "firewall.incoming" and "ssh.login" both plan$
# changes of sshd and ufw, each from the host as it is now: plan$
# them as one control's changes, or in two plans: two changes of$
# the plan act on the same thing.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Already as asked$
   -  Firewall             Enable, SSH allowed$
   -  SSH Login            Root login off$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Already as asked$
   -  DNS                  Already as asked$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

